{"name": "pinblock-target-below-depth-cap-costs-17-reads", "description": "Known-reds entry 14 CONTROL half (GREEN, runs unquarantined). A 12-deep chain sits wholly under the main-panel query's depth-20 recursion cap, so the panel renders every row and PinBlock on the deepest block (dep-11) is a bullet a user could really shift-click: 17 reads, sub-300ms wall, pin dispatches. This is the regime the PINNED 17-read ceiling encodes. Its quarantined twin below crosses the cap and costs 91 reads / 2.2s.", "initial_state": {"wiring": {"storage_adapters": ["Turso"], "sync_adapters": [], "actors": []}}, "transitions": [{"CreateDocument": {"file_name": "doc_0.org"}}, {"BulkExternalAdd": {"doc_uri": "block:ref-doc-0", "blocks": [{"id": "block:dep-0", "parent_id": "block:ref-doc-0", "content": "depth block 0", "content_type": "text", "source_language": null, "source_name": null, "properties": {}, "marks": null, "collapsed": false, "created_at": 1785280251381, "updated_at": 1785280251381}, {"id": "block:dep-1", "parent_id": "block:dep-0", "content": "depth block 1", "content_type": "text", "source_language": null, "source_name": null, "properties": {}, "marks": null, "collapsed": false, "created_at": 1785280251381, "updated_at": 1785280251381}, {"id": "block:dep-2", "parent_id": "block:dep-1", "content": "depth block 2", "content_type": "text", "source_language": null, "source_name": null, "properties": {}, "marks": null, "collapsed": false, "created_at": 1785280251381, "updated_at": 1785280251381}, {"id": "block:dep-3", "parent_id": "block:dep-2", "content": "depth block 3", "content_type": "text", "source_language": null, "source_name": null, "properties": {}, "marks": null, "collapsed": false, "created_at": 1785280251381, "updated_at": 1785280251381}, {"id": "block:dep-4", "parent_id": "block:dep-3", "content": "depth block 4", "content_type": "text", "source_language": null, "source_name": null, "properties": {}, "marks": null, "collapsed": false, "created_at": 178528025138